<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Happy 18th Winnieee 💖</title>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">

<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/canvas-confetti@1.6.0/dist/confetti.browser.min.js"></script>

</head>

<body>

<!-- PASSWORD SCREEN -->

<div id="lockScreen" class="lock-screen">

<h1>🎀 Secret Birthday Surprise 🎀</h1>

<p>Only Winnieee can enter 💖</p>

<input type="password" id="passwordInput" placeholder="Enter Password">

<button onclick="checkPassword()">Unlock ✨</button>

<p id="wrongPassword"></p>

</div>

<!-- MAIN WEBSITE -->

<div id="mainSite" style="display:none;">

<!-- MUSIC -->

<audio id="music" loop>
<source src="song.mp3" type="audio/mp3">
</audio>

<button class="music-btn" onclick="toggleMusic()">
🎵 Music
</button>

<!-- HERO -->

<section class="hero">

<h1 class="title">
Happy 18th Birthday Winnieee 🎂💖
</h1>

<p class="typing"></p>

<!-- COUNTDOWN -->

<div class="countdown">

<div>
<span id="days">00</span>
<p>Days</p>
</div>

<div>
<span id="hours">00</span>
<p>Hours</p>
</div>

<div>
<span id="minutes">00</span>
<p>Minutes</p>
</div>

<div>
<span id="seconds">00</span>
<p>Seconds</p>
</div>

</div>

<button class="main-btn" onclick="showLetter()">
Open Surprise 💌
</button>

</section>

<!-- LETTER -->

<section id="letter" class="letter hidden">

<h2>To My Favorite Human 💞</h2>

<p>
You genuinely became one of the most beautiful parts of my life.

Thank you for every laugh, every game, every comfort,
every memory and every moment.

I hope your 18th year becomes magical because
you deserve the prettiest happiness in the world 💖
</p>

</section>

<!-- CAKE -->

<section class="cake-section">

<h2>Make A Wish 🎂</h2>

<div class="cake">

<div class="candle">
<div class="flame"></div>
</div>

</div>

<button class="blow-btn" onclick="blowCandle()">
Blow Candle 🕯️
</button>

</section>

<!-- MEMORIES -->

<section class="gallery">

<h2>Our Memories 📸</h2>

<div class="photos">

<img src="photo1.jpg">
<img src="photo2.jpg">
<img src="photo3.jpg">
<img src="photo4.jpg">

</div>

</section>

<!-- REASONS -->

<section class="reasons">

<h2>18 Reasons Why You're Special ✨</h2>

<div class="cards">

<div class="card">You're literally sunshine</div>
<div class="card">Your smile heals everything</div>
<div class="card">You stayed when nobody else did</div>
<div class="card">You're my comfort person</div>
<div class="card">You're effortlessly beautiful</div>
<div class="card">You're genuinely precious</div>
<div class="card">You make life feel lighter</div>
<div class="card">You're unforgettable</div>

</div>

</section>

<!-- MINI GAME -->

<section class="game-section">

<h2>Mini Bestie Game 🎮</h2>

<p>
Catch the hearts Winnieee 💖
</p>

<div class="game-area">

<div id="heart">💖</div>

</div>

<p class="score-text">
Score:
<span id="score">0</span>
</p>

</section>


<!-- FINAL SECRET -->

<section class="final">

<h2>One Last Thing... 🥹</h2>

<button class="secret-btn" onclick="showFinalMessage()">
Click For Final Surprise 💌
</button>

<div id="finalMessage" class="hidden final-message">

<p>
Happy 18th birthday to the prettiest soul ever.

Thank you for becoming such an important part of my life.
Thank you for every laugh, every comfort, every memory,
every game, every late-night talk and every tiny moment.

You genuinely made life softer and happier for me.

No matter where life takes us,
you'll always be one of my favorite people ever.

I hope this year brings you endless happiness,
beautiful memories, success, peace,
and everything your heart deserves.

You'll always mean a lot to me Winnieee 💖
</p>

</div>

</section>

</div>

<script src="script.js"></script>

</body>
</html>